OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested for murder after
OL,4,Aelderly woman found dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 36-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a woman in
OL,8,Fher 80s was found dead.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police (TVP) said it was
OL,11,Falerted to an unexplained death at an
OL,12,Faddress on Appleford Drive in Abingdon
OL,13,Fat about 14:20 BST on Thursday
OL,14,Fafternoon.
OL,16,FThe force said officers found a woman
OL,17,Fin her 80s dead at the property, and
OL,18,Fthat her next of kin had been made
OL,19,Faware.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
